Corrected Wave 4 blockers:
- T12 boundary: IReviewRecordRepository.SaveAsync accepts only the trusted firm,
  an already-projected PersistedReviewRecord, and a cancellation token.
  Persistence names no executable CaseReview type, and the production boundary
  continues to forbid it.
- T13 construction: AuthenticationSession.Create validates its structural
  identifiers and UTC creation instant, derives the fixed 30-minute idle and
  8-hour absolute boundaries through SessionLifetimePolicy, and creates only an
  initially-unrevoked state. Persistence needs no reflection or internals grant.
- T15 construction: PurgeOutcome exposes only NoEligibleRecords() and
  RecordsPurged(...), rejects invalid counts, has no public constructor or
  mutable public setter, and renders fixed structural identity only.

